              "value": "PUT the file bytes to upload_url with headers Content-Length: <size> and Content-Range: bytes 0-<size-1>/<size>. No Authorization header. One request is fine for files under 60 MB. On a name clash OneDrive renames the new file instead of replacing; the final name and webUrl are in the PUT response.",
